deprotection,in the dark in alloc deprotection step,attachment to
isocyanide functionalized cysteamine-Trt resin in stage 2,Ugi reaction in
stages 1 and 2,Fmoc-Boc protocol used,solid phase peptide
synthesis,paraformaldehyde used in stage 1,amino acids preactivated for 5
mins before coupling,Fmoc deprotection with piperidine in DMF after every
coupling stage
